cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "MeniBreak: a parsimonious breakpoint panel for meningioma recurrence"
abstract: >-
  Research software implementing a breakpoint-architecture panel for meningioma
  recurrence risk. Derives copy-number change points from segmented data, builds
  arm-relative breakpoint windows, discovers prognostic windows inside training
  folds, and evaluates them with patient-grouped out-of-fold cross-validation.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-24
authors:
  - family-names: Dunbar
    given-names: Andrew R.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndrewDunbar1/MeniBreak"
keywords:
  - meningioma
  - copy-number alteration
  - genomic breakpoints
  - recurrence prediction
